body: "Overlap recheck: pinned CLI SDK workspace-memory rolls up completed tracker context, not per-memory utility; pm-context context-usage records exposure/affinity; pm-memory recall counters measure exposure and PR #5 owns semantic retrieval; pm-rl owns training, evaluation and policy/merge outcomes. This feature supplies explicit auditable memory-specific feedback linked to recalled content and native task outcomes, with complete source denominators."
